    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, I have identified key aspects related to GDPR compliance and regulatory requirements. we standard legal basis for processing personal data is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest. we also have a Data Protection Agreement template version 3.2 available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that we solution does not automate decisions without human validation, we are aligned with the principle of human oversight and no automated decision-making without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, since we operations are intra-EU only, Standard Contractual Clauses or adequacy decisions are not required." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should ensure that we data processing practices adhere to the principles outlined in GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To flag potential legal risks, I would highlight open-source licence compliance and cross-border data flow as areas for consideration, although given we intra-EU operations, cross-border data flow risks may be minimal." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, monitoring AI Act compliance evolution will be essential due to AI Act compliance evolution implications on limited-risk classification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For ensuring we solution meets necessary standards for data protection and security, we can leverage we DPIA support availability and adhere to we standard legal basis for data processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Implementing robust data return and destruction mechanisms upon termination, as outlined in we standard contractual clauses, is also crucial." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, maintaining awareness of prohibited AI practices and enforcing human oversight contractually will help mitigate associated risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, while we appear to be generally compliant with relevant regulations, ongoing monitoring of regulatory updates, especially concerning AI Act, and meticulous adherence to we internal policies on data protection and security are essential for maintaining compliance and minimizing legal risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation must not exceed the budgetary capacities of the local authority, and we must demonstrate an approach allowing we to optimize costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected." ;
