    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities with retrieval strategies such as Dense vector (semantic) and BM25 sparse, combined with chunking strategies like Recursive text splitter and Semantic chunking. 3." ;
