    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our solution meets The client environmental requirements, we can leverage we green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which utilize 100% renewable energy and have a power usage effectiveness of 1.3 and 1.28, respectively." ;
