    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can contribute to reducing energetic consumption by approximately 35% compared to the baseline. we should also consider sustainability trade-offs, such as the tension between high availability and energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate the tension between high availability and energy consumption, we can implement low-power standby mode with a wake-up time of less than 90 seconds, which is compatible with we 99.9% uptime SLA." ;
